&lt;p>ESPHome &lt;em>actions&lt;/em> are how we make an ESPHome device &lt;em>do something.&lt;/em>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Let&amp;rsquo;s begin with an example. Suppose you have a configuration file which contains:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="code-block">
 &lt;button class="copy-button" aria-label="Copy code">
 &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
 role="none"
